================================================================================
DATA NOTICE -- not covered by the MIT grant above
================================================================================

The MIT licence above covers the source code, documentation and figures in this
repository. It does NOT cover the vacancy records under `data/raw/`.

Those records are published as official open data by the Russian state
employment portal Trudvsem ("Работа России"), operated by Роструд:

    Source:  https://opendata.trudvsem.ru/api/v1/vacancies
    Terms:   https://trudvsem.ru/opendata/api

They are redistributed here in gzipped form solely so that the analysis is
reproducible without re-harvesting. The data remains subject to the terms set by
its publisher, and anyone reusing it should consult those terms and cite the
portal as the source. The `collect.py` script can regenerate an equivalent
dataset directly from the API at any time.

Individual vacancy records contain employer contact details that the portal
publishes as part of its open data. No attempt has been made here to
de-anonymise, enrich or re-identify anyone; the analysis is aggregate.
